---
/** Home "Designing Solutions that matter" heading + 4-up stats with count-up. */
---

<section class="section container">
  <div class="solutions__head reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Trusted Worldwide</p>
    <h2 class="solutions__title">Designing Solutions<br />that matter.</h2>
    <p class="solutions__sub">Collaborating with Visionaries Across Industries.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stats" data-stagger>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="65">65</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc">Delivering impactful design, tech, and communication solutions to help organizations grow.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="200">200</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc">Empowering youth with practical skills and confidence through free workshops.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="23">23</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc">Delivering strategic, creative, and measurable results across sectors in our first year.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat__num"><span data-count="9" data-pad="true">09</span>+</div>
      <p class="stat__desc">Mentoring emerging leaders through fellowships to turn ideas into measurable impact.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
